Package: auspol
Title: Australian Election Forecasting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pete", "O", email = "fptpost@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Poll trend estimation, projection and seat simulation for Australian
    federal and state elections. Anchored on the AE Forecasts methodology
    (see docs/ANCHOR-MODEL.md) with planned extensions using ABS Census
    demographics at electorate level.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
